<title>UK: EIB sets 300 mln Danish crown 7-year domestic bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 300 mln Danish crown 7-year domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DKR   COUPON     4.0 PCT   MATURITY    15.DEC.04</p>
